t's what  Kevin Feige is going to want to do he's  going to bring in some of the  lesser-known  x-men and bring them to the big screen  and some of the bigger ones are  unfortunately going to take a seat back  for a little bit so the Fox x-men films  can die down for example another report  from Mikey Sutton says that magneto will  eventually come and be the villain but  also will eventually go on to lead the  x-men against Doctor Doom but in this  report he does state that this is going  to be several several years down the  road most likely not until the next  Avengers in game level event and that's  because most of the movies that Fox did  concerning the x-men had magneto in it  his character and other main characters  need to cool down a bit until they come  into the MCU  however they are keeping characters like  Cyclops Nightcrawler and a storm and  storm is the second thing that this  report talks about  that is really really big because her  story is going to tie the MCU together  in a really big way this report says  that storm is going to be from what  Conda this is something that many many  people have been expecting for a while I  myself have done a few videos on this  and that is because of the relationship  between storm and T'Challa aka Black  Panther they have a very long history  together in the comics and their story  actually leads up to the Avengers vs.  x-men Black Panther and storm or to  chala and Ororo both actually meet when  they are young in fact their children  when they meet for the very first time  Aurora was in Cairo and her parents were  killed which left her alone wandering  the desert she eventually decides to go  back to her mother's homeland in Kenya  but while on her travels she comes  across to Chawla who was being kidnapped  at the time using her weather  controlling powers she rescues him the  two of them hit it off and have instant  chemistry becoming friends and a little  bit more now eventually they would grow  up and black 