  part of that program according to this  report which probably means that  Wolverine has been in the MCU for some  time now he's been a project and  experiment of the Weapon X program again  Captain America was weapon number one  and it's been many many years since  Captain America the First Avenger there  are definitely more than 10 Weapon X  experiments already in the MCU  and fun fact Deadpool is part of the  Weapon X program as well and right now  of course we know that Marvel is working  on another Deadpool film so according to  this report we are getting the x-men in  the MCU soon with a new lineup  Wolverine of course eventually making  his way and Deadpool of course  eventually but what do you think about  this report what do you think about the  new lineup what do you think about storm  being from Wakanda and do you think  she's going to have a relationship with  Black Panther and what do you think  about Wolverine coming in with the  Weapon X program let me know what you  think about all of this and the comments  down below don't forget to like this  video and subscribe to stay up-to-date  on everything relating to the MCU for  live updates you can follow me on  Twitter and as always thank you all so  much for watching  woof woof

